description "Mortar Stormtrooper

^2Weaponry:
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 10% more charged FP damage
- Packered Mortar Launcher (10)
-- 50% less damage
-- Staggers/slows on det
-- 43% smaller splash
- 4 V-59 Concussion Grenades

^6Inventory:
- Medpac ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- 10% less knockback Taken
- Getup (2)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen: 1/.5s to 40

This veteran has seen a lot of combat and managed to survive, a true feat for Imperial foot soldiers."